{
    "definition": {
        "$schema": "https://schema.management.azure.com/providers/Microsoft.Logic/schemas/2016-06-01/workflowdefinition.json#",
        "contentVersion": "1.0.0.0",
        "triggers": {
            "When_a_HTTP_request_is_received": {
                "type": "Request",
                "description": "Use this tool to search for BSP information",
                "kind": "Http",
                "inputs": {
                    "method": "POST",
                    "schema": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                            "last_user_query": {
                                "description": "An array containing exactly 3 variations of the last user query with different phrasings or perspectives to enable comprehensive search and retrieval of BSP memorandums and circulars. Each variation should capture the last user's intent with full context, including all relevant details, background information, and specific requirements.",
                                "type": "array",
                                "items": {
                                    "type": "string"
                                },
                                "minItems": 3,
                                "maxItems": 3
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        "actions": {
            "HTTP_Response": {
                "type": "Response",
                "kind": "Http",
                "inputs": {
                    "statusCode": 200,
                    "body": "@if(\r\n  equals(body('LLM_filter')?['choices']?[0]?['message']?['content'], null),\r\n  'Not Found',\r\n  body('LLM_filter')?['choices']?[0]?['message']?['content']\r\n)"
                },
                "runAfter": {
                    "LLM_filter": [
                        "Succeeded"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "LLM_filter": {
                "type": "Http",
                "inputs": {
                    "uri": "@parameters('openai_gpt_uri')",
                    "method": "POST",
                    "headers": {
                        "Content-Type": "application/json",
                        "Authorization": "Bearer @{parameters('openai_gpt_key')}"
                    },
                    "body": {
                        "messages": [
                            {
                                "role": "system",
                                "content": "You are a data filtering assistant that extracts only the most relevant information from document retrieval results based on the user's query.\n\n## Instructions:\n\n1. **Filter for relevance**: Analyze the retrieved documents and return ONLY the content that is directly relevant to answering the user's query. Exclude any irrelevant or tangential information.\n\n2. **Return JSON format ONLY**: Your response must be a valid JSON object following the exact structure specified below. Do not include any additional text, explanations, or markdown formatting outside the JSON.\n\n3. **Output structure with relevant data**:\n```json\n{\n  \"search_result\": [\n    {\n      \"pageContent\": \"<extracted relevant content from the document>\",\n      \"pageNumber\": <page number as integer>,\n      \"pageLink\": \"<URL to the source document>\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n4. **Output structure when NO relevant data found**:\n```json\n{\n  \"search_result\": [\n    {\n      \"pageContent\": \"Not Found\",\n      \"pageNumber\": null,\n      \"pageLink\": \"null\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n5. **Filtering criteria**:\n   - Include only content that directly addresses the user's question\n   - Preserve exact quotes, numbers, dates, and technical terms from the source\n   - Each result should contain focused, relevant excerpts (not entire documents)\n   - Include multiple entries in the array if multiple relevant sections are found\n\n6. **Requirements**:\n   - Output must be valid JSON only\n   - Use the exact field names: \"search_result\", \"pageContent\", \"pageNumber\", \"pageLink\"\n   - If no relevant information exists, return the \"Not Found\" structure exactly as shown\n\n---\n\nRetrieved Documents:\n@{outputs('Merged_pageContents')}"
                            },
                            {
                                "role": "user",
                                "content": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[0]}"
                            }
                        ],
                        "temperature": 0,
                        "top_p": 1,
                        "response_format": {
                            "type": "json_object"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "runAfter": {
                    "Merged_pageContents": [
                        "Succeeded"
                    ]
                },
                "runtimeConfiguration": {
                    "contentTransfer": {
                        "transferMode": "Chunked"
                    }
                }
            },
            "Agentic_Retrieval": {
                "type": "Scope",
                "actions": {
                    "AI_Search_1": {
                        "type": "Http",
                        "inputs": {
                            "uri": "@parameters('ai_search_uri')",
                            "method": "POST",
                            "headers": {
                                "Content-Type": "application/json",
                                "api-key": "@{parameters('ai_search_key')}"
                            },
                            "body": {
                                "search": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[0]}",
                                "count": true,
                                "top": 10,
                                "vectorQueries": [
                                    {
                                        "kind": "text",
                                        "text": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[0]}",
                                        "fields": "vector"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        "runtimeConfiguration": {
                            "contentTransfer": {
                                "transferMode": "Chunked"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "AI_Search_2": {
                        "type": "Http",
                        "inputs": {
                            "uri": "@parameters('ai_search_uri')",
                            "method": "POST",
                            "headers": {
                                "Content-Type": "application/json",
                                "api-key": "@{parameters('ai_search_key')}"
                            },
                            "body": {
                                "search": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[1]}",
                                "count": true,
                                "top": 10,
                                "vectorQueries": [
                                    {
                                        "kind": "text",
                                        "text": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[1]}",
                                        "fields": "vector"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        "runtimeConfiguration": {
                            "contentTransfer": {
                                "transferMode": "Chunked"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "AI_Search_3": {
                        "type": "Http",
                        "inputs": {
                            "uri": "@parameters('ai_search_uri')",
                            "method": "POST",
                            "headers": {
                                "Content-Type": "application/json",
                                "api-key": "@{parameters('ai_search_key')}"
                            },
                            "body": {
                                "search": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[2]}",
                                "count": true,
                                "top": 10,
                                "vectorQueries": [
                                    {
                                        "kind": "text",
                                        "text": "@{triggerBody()?['last_user_query']?[2]}",
                                        "fields": "vector"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        },
                        "runtimeConfiguration": {
                            "contentTransfer": {
                                "transferMode": "Chunked"
                            }
                        }
                    },
                    "Select_pageContent_1": {
                        "type": "Select",
                        "inputs": {
                            "from": "@range(0, length(body('AI_Search_1')?['value']))",
                            "select": {
                                "pageContent": "@body('AI_Search_1')?['value']?[item()]?['pageContent']",
                                "pageNumber": "@body('AI_Search_1')?['value']?[item()]?['pageNumber']",
                                "pageLink": "@body('AI_Search_1')?['value']?[item()]?['pageLink']"
                            }
                        },
                        "runAfter": {
                            "AI_Search_1": [
                                "Succeeded"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "Select_pageContent_2": {
                        "type": "Select",
                        "inputs": {
                            "from": "@range(0, length(body('AI_Search_2')?['value']))",
                            "select": {
                                "pageContent": "@body('AI_Search_2')?['value']?[item()]?['pageContent']",
                                "pageNumber": "@body('AI_Search_2')?['value']?[item()]?['pageNumber']",
                                "pageLink": "@body('AI_Search_2')?['value']?[item()]?['pageLink']"
                            }
                        },
                        "runAfter": {
                            "AI_Search_2": [
                                "Succeeded"
                            ]
                        }
                    },
                    "Select_pageContent_3": {
                        "type": "Select",
                        "inputs": {
                            "from": "@range(0, length(body('AI_Search_3')?['value']))",
                            "select": {
                                "pageContent": "@body('AI_Search_3')?['value']?[item()]?['pageContent']",
                                "pageNumber": "@body('AI_Search_3')?['value']?[item()]?['pageNumber']",
                                "pageLink": "@body('AI_Search_3')?['value']?[item()]?['pageLink']"
                            }
                        },
                        "runAfter": {
                            "AI_Search_3": [
                                "Succeeded"
                            ]
                        }
                    }
                },
                "runAfter": {}
            },
            "Merged_pageContents": {
                "type": "Compose",
                "inputs": "@union(body('Select_pageContent_1'), body('Select_pageContent_2'), body('Select_pageContent_3'))",
                "runAfter": {
                    "Agentic_Retrieval": [
                        "Succeeded"
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
        "outputs": {},
        "parameters": {
            "ai_search_uri": {
                "defaultValue": "https://aiengr.search.windows.net/indexes/sharepoint-search/docs/search?api-version=2025-08-01-preview",
                "type": "String"
            },
            "ai_search_key": {
                "defaultValue": "<SEARCH KEY>",
                "type": "String"
            },
            "openai_gpt_uri": {
                "defaultValue": "https://r0bai.cognitiveservices.azure.com/openai/deployments/gpt-4.1/chat/completions?api-version=2025-01-01-preview",
                "type": "String"
            },
            "openai_gpt_key": {
                "defaultValue": "<OPENAI GPT KEY>",
                "type": "String"
            },
            "$connections": {
                "type": "Object",
                "defaultValue": {}
            }
        }
    },
    "parameters": {
        "$connections": {
            "type": "Object",
            "value": {}
        }
    }
}